==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|frm|en}} {{m|frm|inflexible}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|inflexibilis}}. See also {{prefix|in|flexible|lang=en}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ɪnˈflɛksəbl̩/|lang=en}}
* {{audio|en-us-inflexible.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Not [[flexible]]; not capable of [[bend]]ing or being bent; [[stiff]]; [[rigid]]; [[firm]]; [[unyielding]].
# Not willing to [[change]], e.g. one's [[opinion]] or [[habits]]; [[obstinate]]; [[stubborn]]; [[resolute]]; [[determined]].

====Synonyms====
* See also [[Wikisaurus:obstinate]]
* [[unflexible]]

====Antonyms====
* [[flexible]]

